    "title": "Studying Sentence Patterns to Improve Your Writing, Part Two",
    "deck": "This week, we give you more information about a common sentence pattern in English: the linking verb pattern. Learning how to use linking verb patterns will help you improve your writing. You can think about creative ways to use them, or you can learn to recognize when you use them too often.",
    "source": "VOA Learning English",
    "sourceId": "voa",
    "sourceUrl": "https://learningenglish.voanews.com/a/studying-sentence-patterns-to-improve-writing-part-2/3459324.html",
