    "title": "'The Open Boat' by Stephen Crane, Part One",
    "deck": "American Stories presents a short story based on the writer's real-life experiences after a shipwreck. Crane was traveling from the United States to Cuba as a newspaper reporter. One night, his ship hit a sandbar. It sank in the Atlantic Ocean, off the coast of Florida.",
    "source": "VOA Learning English",
