    "title": "'The Fall of the House of Usher,' by Edgar Allan Poe, Part Three",
    "deck": "The childhood friend of Roderick Usher is witness to the horrifying end of the mysterious Usher line in the third and final part of Edgar Allan Poe's \"The Fall of the House of Usher.\"",
    "source": "VOA Learning English",
    "sourceId": "voa",
