    "title": "The Lost Stradivarius",
    "deck": "John Meade Falkner — A talented young musician comes into possession of an old manuscript and a beautiful violin, and is consumed by the history they carry.",
    "source": "Standard Ebooks",
    "sourceId": "standard-ebooks",
    "sourceUrl": "https://standardebooks.org/ebooks/john-meade-falkner/the-lost-stradivarius",
