    "title": "How Croatian communities are taking on planned poultry slaughterhouses",
    "deck": "Backed by Ukrainian oligarchs, the projects would dramatically increase the country’s poultry output and place a significant burden on local lives and natural resources.",
    "source": "Global Voices",
    "sourceId": "global-voices",
