    "title": "Thousands of little penguins will be vaccinated against bird flu down under",
    "deck": "“These penguins are part of what makes our community so special. We are lucky to share our home with them, and we’re going to do our best to protect them.”",
    "source": "Global Voices",
    "sourceId": "global-voices",
    "sourceUrl": "https://globalvoices.org/2026/08/26/thousands-of-little-penguins-will-be-vaccinated-against-bird-flu-down-under/",
